an islamic  jihad five of them  from that uh that faction and there have  been rockets fired out of gaza in recent  days israeli air strikes as well  at a time when the israeli foreign  minister yai lapid is talking about a  new policy towards gaza egypt very much  crucial in any changes on that front as  well so those are the sorts of things  that will be talked about uh but a lot  of it is as well as about a public show  that this relationship is is sort of  alive in kicking and already we've seen  some other uh  things happening as a result of that the  egyptian national airline will be  running for flight today to tel aviv a  week rather to tel aviv from next month  and there have been tourist restrictions  lifted for more israelis to go into the  sinai peninsula as well so a couple of  concrete achievements being announced  already  harry force up there following that  meeting for us from west jerusalem thank  you harry
 

